        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 18324739-f01e-47f4-8c8b-c7f880805491).Image",
        "Description": "A new criminal case has invaded all police stations in Chongqing: A homeless serial killer that kills those who sleep away from the rain.\rAlthough poetic, this recent case has gained a lot of attention from the media.\rThis can be a good opportunity to cover up your next mission: A professional trio of former ICA agents.\rThey have a peculiar modus operandi, where the infiltrator scouts the area, and then the assassin couple breachs in to do job.\rUse this terror in your favor. Good luck, 47.",
